# Table too wide for a grid
────────────────────────────────────────

Six columns of unbreakable identifiers
cannot fit a narrow terminal, so the
table degrades to a vertical list
instead of a broken grid.

Row 1
  identifier: alpha_one
  descriptor: beta_two
  qualifier: gamma_three
  annotation: delta_four
  とても長い日本語の見出し: これはとても
                            長い説明文で
                            す
  remainder: epsilon_five

Row 2
  identifier: zeta_six
  descriptor: eta_seven
  qualifier: theta_eight
  annotation: iota_nine
